+    /**
+     * The reader of a settings key a Lujarch permission covers, or null when nothing covers
+     * this read: another key, a uid below 10000, a system or
+     * platform-signed app (the callers {@link #enforceSettingReadable} exempts). A failed
+     * lookup allows (logged).
